  "question": {
    "text": "In the nucleophilic substitution reactions <math> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>S</mtext> <mtext>N</mtext> </msub> <mtext>2</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mrow> <mtext>or&nbsp;S</mtext></mrow> <mtext>N</mtext> </msub> <mtext>1</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math> the reactivity of alkyl halides follows the sequence",
